==Battleground==
*5 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*7 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 8.67~12 seconds<sup>260f~360f</sup>.
*1 [[Aku Gory]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'Behemoth]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Relic Doge]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**5 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn, delay 8~11.33 seconds<sup>240f~340f</sup>.
**20 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn, delay 3.33~8 seconds<sup>100f~240f</sup>.
**2 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn, delay 56.67~63.33 seconds<sup>1,700f~1,900f</sup>.
**2 [[Oldhorn]]s spawn, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
You need to bring at least 4 attackers; it's highly recommended that you bring [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Slapstick Cat]] and/or [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] since they have great Area Attack damage and the former is Strong against [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relics]]. [[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|Cat Mask Doron]] is also recommended to disable the Oldhorns.

Long Distance [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Ubers]] are recommended, since they can kill [[Le'Behemoth]], and [[Lilin (Uber Rare Cat)|Divine Lilin]] is also good to have with her anti-[[Shield]] abilities. [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] is really useful here to wipe out the Relic Doges and deal some damage to the [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]], which can be enough to force him back.

==Trivia==
*Clay Pot Soul Food's Japanese name, Kaengata Doki de Ofukuro no Aji (火焔型土器でおふくろの味, Mom's-cooking-taste Flame-style Earthenware"), mentions ''[https://youtu.be/mKxCi8YiT2E kaengata doki]'' (火焔型土器, "flame-style earthenware"), a type of pottery from Japan's prehistoric [[wikipedia:Jōmon period|Jōmon period]].
**Although ''[[wikipedia:ja:おふくろの味|ofukuro no aji]]'' (おふくろの味) literally translates to "taste of mom", it generally refers to the homemade meals one eats during their childhood, especially made by their mother, and dishes that evoke such a taste ("like mom used to make").

